Separately distributed software
===============================

The SLAM pipeline runs ORB-SLAM3 (https://github.com/UZ-SLAMLab/ORB_SLAM3),
licensed GPLv3, inside separate Docker images (chicheng/orb_slam3 and
solariandev/orb_slam3). ORB-SLAM3 is not part of this package's source and
is not covered by this license. slam/Dockerfile.lumi only describes how the
solariandev/orb_slam3 image is built.
